Viktor 10.10.2026: «Положил в artwork/loras/<семейство>/»; «предусмотри скан поддиректорий»; «Если возле адаптера лежит его картинка, её тоже возьми в представление. И прикрути сканирование Civitai по хешу»; «Адаптеры пользователи пусть себе тянут по твоему Гайду прямо в комнате».

Under the painter: the adapters of its family, each with its picture, its name, its trigger words (a click puts one into the prompt) and its strength, up to four, kept per family in this browser. «Add…» opens the library: the folders, the cards with their pictures, a search, each adapter's Civitai mark, and «Look up on Civitai» for the ones not yet known (the lab sends the file's SHA-256 alone); an empty family says where adapters go and how to find them. A run carries them, its stage says them, To the form and Again take them.

Suite: 573/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
